  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n- restore versioned state with generated JSON\n  Make VersionedState.Version publicly init-settable so consumer JsonSerializerContext types can deserialize stored versions. Stamp a copied record on each state-manager write, preserving fresh recovery versions without mutating the caller's input.\n  Add a separate consumer-assembly regression suite covering generated and reflection JSON round trips, earlier stored JSON, and manager writes and reads. Document the version behavior and migration guidance for package users.\n- release journaling with messaging preview version\n  Build, validate, and publish Journaling in the Messaging workflow. Derive its NuGet package version from the matching Messaging numeric version and append -preview, so consumers can identify the corresponding core release while the Journaling dependency remains experimental.\n  Remove the separate Journaling workflow and version configuration, and use Messaging release tags for its package notes.",
